    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d582">

                <pb facs="0652" n="[1330]" sameAs="frus:frus1863p2/pg1330"/>

                <head>Mr. F. W. Seward to Mr.
                        Winthrop.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 75.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1862-10-16"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 16, 1862.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Your despatch, No. 50, in regard to the
                    employment of foreign officers in our service, has been received.</p>
                <p>The course which you have adopted does not meet with the approval of the
                    department.</p>
                <pb facs="0653" n="1331" xml:id="pg1331"/>
                <p>Its views upon this subject were communicated to you and the other consular
                    officers of the United States in circular No. 11, on the 8th of May last. A copy
                    of that circular is herewith again transmitted, by which you will be careful
                    hereafter to be guided.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>F. W. SEWARD, <hi rendition="#italic">Assistant
                    Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>W. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winthrop</hi>, Esq., <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >United States Consul, Malta.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d582-a1.xml" xpointer="d582-a1"/>
            </div>
